OL,3,AUS and Iran trade strikes for first
OL,4,Atime in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Central Command (Centcom) said it
OL,7,Ftook "limited, precise action" after
OL,8,Fobserving Iran preparing to "launch
OL,9,Frockets and deploy sea mines into the
OL,10,FStrait of Hormuz", according to its
OL,11,Fspokesperson.
OL,13,FIran said it had struck US military
OL,14,Fbases in Jordan in response, with
OL,15,FJordan's army saying it had intercepted
OL,16,Feight missiles early on Monday morning.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
