OL,3,AThe jury's options in Lindsay Clancy's
OL,4,Amurder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FLindsay Clancy's murder trial has
OL,7,Fgripped the American public for the
OL,8,Flast five weeks.
OL,10,FThe 36-year-old former nurse killed her
OL,11,Fthree small children in the basement of
OL,12,Ftheir family home in Massachusetts.
OL,14,FCharged with three counts of
OL,15,Ffirst-degree murder, she does not
OL,16,Fdispute killing her two sons and
OL,17,Fdaughter in 2023.
OL,19,FBut her lawyer argues she was suffering
OL,20,Ffrom postpartum psychosis at the time,
OL,21,Fand therefore could not distinguish
OL,22,Fright from wrong.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
